# Perf, resilience & a11y

## 2-Second Rule
- Non-critical fetches (related products, ads, secondary widgets): wrap with `withTimeout` from `lib/timeout.ts` (2000ms).
- Always provide Skeleton or empty fallback on timeout/failure.

## Route boundaries
- Every route segment that needs graceful failure: `error.tsx` and `loading.tsx` with clear Shadcn-friendly messages.

## PSI guardrails (`0_PSI_ACCEPTANCE.md`, `6_PERF_BUDGETS.md`)
- GA / Vercel Analytics: interaction-only load.
- Do not chase unscored unused CSS/JS diagnostics if PSI ≥ 90.
- Do not `dynamic()` the entire Navbar / root shell without PSI retest.

## A11y checklist highlights
- Touch targets ≥ 48×48px.
- One primary link per card (`7_A11Y_CHECKLIST.md`).
